// expect: trap
// A channel `after` made is delivered to by its clock alone: a send to it traps, though it has room
// (`timing_after_try_send.avin` tries a `trySend` and a timed send, `timing_ticker_send.avin` a
// select's send arm).
import avin.threads.after
import avin.time.{epochMicros, hours}

main()
  val a = after(hours(1))
  println("before")
  a.send(epochMicros(0))
  println("after")
